{#
  Bill Pay mock frame — placeholder for a future iframe of the Bill Pay
  mock. Sits in the hero's own content column, 170px below the hero
  subheader, and bleeds from the green hero section down into the white
  section below it (same overflow:visible bleed technique CLAUDE.md
  documents for hero illustrations: a zero-size layout container so the
  visible element inside can render past its own box without moving
  anything else). Static layout only for now — no src, no script, no
  motion; a later phase adds the src.

  Placed via hero.njk's optional caller() slot:
    {% call hero(...) %}{{ mockFrame() }}{% endcall %}
  which renders this directly after div.section-hero, inside the hero
  section's own section__slot.
#}
{% macro mockFrame() %}
<div class="mock-frame">
  <iframe class="mock-frame__iframe"></iframe>
</div>
{% endmacro %}
